                <pb facs="0641" n="571" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg571"/>

                <head>No. 9.</head>

                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To the Citizen President of the Republic :</hi>
                </p>
                <p>A courier has already left with lists of the prisoners.</p>
                <p>The attorney who is to conduct the case of Maximilian has permitted him to write
                    to you. The attorney has a doubt. As you know there are three persons to be
                    prosecuted, and in order to effect the reference which is preparing for the
                    defence, only twenty-four hours are allowed. The doubt is, whether this period
                    is to be allowed to each one of the parties defending, or for the defence of the
                    three.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ESCOBEDO.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
